data: {"id": "4af9f9f9dc214c3c-final", "run_id": "4af9f9f9dc214c3c", "seq": 1173, "ts_ms": 1789129392589, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v06/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v06/workload 配置了 HostPath 挂载卷 'input' 指向节点 node2 上的路径 /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input，该路径在节点上不存在或类型不匹配，导致挂载持续失败。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubelet` | `FailedMount`: `hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a directory` | 证实挂载卷 'input' 因源路径类型不匹配导致挂载失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `kubelet` | `FailedMount`: `timed out waiting for the condition` | 证实挂载操作超时，验证挂载失败为持续性故障 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `kubernetes` | `pod.phase: Pending`, `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` | 定义异常实体状态：容器处于等待启动阶段，未进入运行 |\n| 4 | K8s State | `kubernetes` | `pod.condition.ContainersReady: False`, `reason: ContainersNotReady` | 证实 Pod 未就绪，由容器挂载失败直接触发 |\n| 5 | Metric | `prometheus` | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason: 1` (reason=ContainerCreating) | 独立观测确认容器状态确认为 ContainerCreating，与 K8s 事件一致 |\n\n**证据分析**：\n- 证据 1 和 2 直接指出了导致故障的机制：挂载卷 'input' 指向的 HostPath 路径存在类型冲突（非目录），导致 `FailedMount` 错误并持续超时。\n- 证据 3、4 和 5 从 Pod 生命周期和等待原因维度，印证了该挂载失败直接阻塞了容器的启动和就绪。\n- 日志与 Tracing 缺失，原因确认为容器未启动（`ContainerCreating`），无应用层数据可获取，不影响根因判定。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nHostPath 路径 /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input 类型不匹配 → kubelet 挂载检查失败 (FailedMount) → 容器持续处于 ContainerCreating 状态 → Pod 状态 Pending 且未就绪\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Pod 的 HostPath 挂载配置错误**。\n具体而言，Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` 中名为 `input` 的卷挂载指向节点 `node2` 上的路径 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input`，但该路径在节点上不存在或类型不匹配（`hostPath type check failed`），导致 `kubelet` 挂载操作超时并拒绝启动容器。该结论由 K8s 事件日志（证据 1, 2）、Pod 状态（证据 3, 4）及 Prometheus 指标（证据 5）共同支撑。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 9.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 557.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v06/workload: 557.4s (Evidence 551.1s, RCA 6.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v06/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 587.219, "metrics": {"run_id": "4af9f9f9dc214c3c", "mttr": {"value": "9.8m", "seconds": 587.2270956039429, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.95, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.75, "weighted_score": 0.15}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 587227.0956039429, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 581967.5171375275, "tool_calls": 20, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 6, "successful_tool_calls": 18, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 12490